# Cursor reads AGENTS.md, CLAUDE.md and .cursor/rules out of EVERY subdirectory
# and counts them as "Rules" in the context window.
#
# .holorepo/ holds HoloRepo candidate worktrees: full checkouts, each carrying
# its own copy of those rule files. With 23 worktrees nested here, Cursor loaded
# ~350K tokens of duplicated rules and overflowed the 256K window (2026-09-02).
# The worktrees stay; Cursor just must not walk them from this workspace.
.holorepo/
.claude/worktrees/
.scratch/
**/.scratch/
